  <div class="cover">
    <h1>KITAKYUSHU</h1>
    <p class="where">FUKUOKA · KOKURA</p>
    <p class="when">2026.12.14 — 12.18</p>
    <p class="count" id="count"></p>
    <div class="trail" aria-label="整趟路線">
      <span class="node">台北 12.14</span><span class="arr">→</span>
      <span class="node">博多 3 晚</span><span class="arr">→</span>
      <span class="node">小倉 1 晚</span><span class="arr">→</span>
      <span class="node">台北 12.18 夜</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="days">
    <button class="daycard d1" data-page="day1"><span class="k"><b>D1</b><small>12.14</small></span><span class="v"><h3>博多・天神・藥院</h3><p>川端通商店街、櫛田神社、天神地下街、藥院雜貨小店</p></span></button>
    <button class="daycard d2" data-page="day2"><span class="k"><b>D2</b><small>12.15</small></span><span class="v"><h3>太宰府・大濠公園</h3><p>太宰府天滿宮、梅枝餅、福岡城跡、博多逛街</p></span></button>
    <button class="daycard d3" data-page="day3"><span class="k"><b>D3</b><small>12.16</small></span><span class="v"><h3>糸島</h3><p>櫻井神社、海鮮丼、櫻井二見浦夫婦岩、絕景 MARKET</p></span></button>
    <button class="daycard d4" data-page="day4"><span class="k"><b>D4</b><small>12.17</small></span><span class="v"><h3>博多 → 小倉・皿倉山</h3><p>旦過市場、小倉城、皿倉山夜景，晚上住小倉</p></span></button>
    <button class="daycard d5" data-page="day5"><span class="k"><b>D5</b><small>12.18</small></span><span class="v"><h3>門司港・唐戶</h3><p>門司港懷舊區、燒咖哩、唐戶市場、赤間神宮，夜間飛回台北</p></span></button>
